          "docs": "Create a site template with automatic upgrade settings and template\nvariables available to WLAN configuration.\n\nTo assign a Site template to a site, use the [Update Site](/#operations/updateSiteInfo) endpoint and specify the Site template ID in the `sitetemplate_id` field of the request body.'"
